# =====================================================================
# WP MONITOR - Node.js / TypeScript / WhatsApp / Security Project
# =====================================================================
# This file excludes dependencies, compiled files, credentials,
# authentication sessions, user data, packet captures, audit evidence,
# local databases, logs, temporary files and development artifacts.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - Never commit WhatsApp sessions, API keys, tokens or private keys.
# - Keep package lockfiles tracked:
#   package-lock.json, yarn.lock, pnpm-lock.yaml, bun.lock or bun.lockb.
# =====================================================================


